{"unit_id":"Castor6__BrowserRig#card-zh","repo":"Castor6/BrowserRig","commit":"ffe0f5e6ba4fcd65658855f8a244307d9db92352","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserRig 将 DSH 接入用户现有的 Chromium 浏览器，为每个 DSH 会话保留持久页面。它注册 Playwright 执行、接管活动标签页、查看状态、重置页面、读取执行记录和登记问题报告等工具，并能返回日志、结构化结果和图像。适合需要从 DSH 检查网页、使用已登录浏览器会话或自动化网页流程的用户。需要 Node.js 22.22.0 以上版本、Chromium 系浏览器及 BrowserRig 扩展，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-plugin.ts:31-53","src/dsh-adapter.ts:525-668","README.md:45-100"]}
{"unit_id":"Castor6__BrowserRig#card-en","repo":"Castor6/BrowserRig","commit":"ffe0f5e6ba4fcd65658855f8a244307d9db92352","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"BrowserRig connects DSH to an existing Chromium browser. Its tools run Playwright code, adopt the active tab, inspect status, reset pages, and read execution history. Results include logs and structured values. Requires Node.js 22.22+, Chromium, and the BrowserRig extension.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-plugin.ts:31-53","src/dsh-adapter.ts:525-668","README.md:45-100"]}
