{"unit_id":"Castor6__BrowserRig#feature-1","repo":"Castor6/BrowserRig","commit":"ffe0f5e6ba4fcd65658855f8a244307d9db92352","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserRig 的功能「运行网页脚本」：在当前 DSH 会话的持久页面运行 Playwright JavaScript，并返回执行结果、日志和诊断信息。调用 browserrig_execute 提交脚本。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-adapter.ts:555-588"]}
{"unit_id":"Castor6__BrowserRig#feature-2","repo":"Castor6/BrowserRig","commit":"ffe0f5e6ba4fcd65658855f8a244307d9db92352","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserRig 的功能「接管当前标签页」：将用户最近聚焦窗口的活动 Chromium 标签页作为当前 DSH 会话的持久 BrowserRig 页面。调用 browserrig_adopt_active 后返回被接管页面的网址。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-adapter.ts:590-604"]}
{"unit_id":"Castor6__BrowserRig#feature-3","repo":"Castor6/BrowserRig","commit":"ffe0f5e6ba4fcd65658855f8a244307d9db92352","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserRig 的功能「检查连接状态」：读取 BrowserRig relay、浏览器扩展和当前 DSH 会话的浏览器状态，不启动或更改浏览器运行时。调用 browserrig_status 可查看结构化状态结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-adapter.ts:606-617"]}
{"unit_id":"Castor6__BrowserRig#feature-4","repo":"Castor6/BrowserRig","commit":"ffe0f5e6ba4fcd65658855f8a244307d9db92352","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"BrowserRig 的功能「读取执行记录」：按需查看当前 DSH 会话最近的 BrowserRig 执行历史，用于诊断或回顾操作。调用 browserrig_journal 并可指定要返回的记录数，默认读取 20 条。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/dsh-adapter.ts:631-644"]}
